stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Initializing
    Initializing --> LoadingSample: editor mounts
    LoadingSample --> Editing: local loading timer ends
    Editing --> Editing: input updates local state
    Editing --> LanguageLabelChanged: choose language label
    LanguageLabelChanged --> Editing
    Editing --> [*]: route unmounts or reload
    note right of Editing
      There is no synchronization or persistence.
      Reload restores the sample content.
    end note
